# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). For dusk (game/daycycle.js, game/worldclock.js; nothing plays now).
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
title    Dusk
composer Claude
about    Night falls: a crystal run falling over A minor and D minor, a low singing bowl, and the bird's wide call, then once more an octave lower.
tempo    90
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: bird sweep harm bowl

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.35 rev=0.75
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.26 pan=-0.3 rev=0.65
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.22 pan=0    center=A4 att=0.4 rel=1.2
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.38 pan=0.1  rev=0.6

pattern fall
sweep   | E6- C6- A5- E5- C5- A4- | _ |
harm    | [Am]?----------- | [Dm]?----------- |
bowl    | _ | D3----------- |
bird    | .----- E6 A5+B5---- | A5 D5+E5---------- |

loop fall
